<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58685" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>docked</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόρυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.117
				</span></i>
			; of oxen, <i>stump-horned</i> or <i>hornless</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ γένος τῶν βοῶν τὸ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.29
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ κόλε</span>, addressed to a
			hegoat, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				8.51
			</span></i> (s.v.l.); of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράστης</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				260
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind of
			goat <i>without horns</i>, prob. the animal described by <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				7.4.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόλος μάχη</span>, name of <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8
			</span></i> init.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοβομάχη</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
